{"slug":"mission","base_version":1,"body":"Energy should create value where it is produced — ownership, income, and control stay local.

A community that produces its own energy should own the panels, keep the income and set the rules. We build the software and the legal scaffolding so that is the easy path, not the hard one.

Everything else — the hardware, the connectors, the credits — is in service of that. If a decision moves value away from the community, it is the wrong decision.","lines":[],"diff":"Ownership and control added after the first pilots showed savings alone did not keep communities together.","heard":["9125dcd85d2c25920ddf1a5d74d6e50ff29a0d88761c25c3acedce2569c5a82f","909f2c28affc0432356263d677eb4ebcfad43fdaffcf6baa8dff80256c29af9c","72a08756f40ecb64651978d15582395f8a1d913a7625d1f92647d9532b91acf4"]}

